flowchart TD
  Source[Session / Direct Experience / Artifact] --> Consent[Explicit Scope and Consent]
  Consent --> Snapshot[Immutable Source Snapshot]
  Snapshot --> Scan[Secret PII Injection Scan]
  Scan --> Tags[Tag Eligibility and Match]
  Tags --> Extract[High-value Extraction]
  Extract --> Similarity[Existing Tactic Search]
  Similarity --> Candidate[NEW or SUPPLEMENT Candidate]
  Candidate --> Review[User Diff Review]
  Review -->|approve| Draft[DRAFT Tactic Version]
  Review -->|reject| Archive[Rejected Candidate Audit]
  Draft --> Lifecycle[Simulation / Canary / Testing]
